    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Christopher Hurkens",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106195884168283717568/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK0zitlVcF6TlxuS-W6fZWgmVQaz4Z5uGk5_XeiH2PisvKt8PCO=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Pros: It's a cheap motel.\nCons: It's a cheap motel.\nInnkeeper was super nice and check in and out was a breeze. Despite a noisy location the room was reasonably quiet. Bathroom was newer looking, clean, and in good shape. But the rooms left much to be desired. The A/C barely worked, and the outlet it was plugged into was missing it's cover and dangerously loose. There was no outlets between the beds and no nightstands on the outsides. The lamp that was there wasn't and couldn't be plugged in, and the outlet on one bed was behind the headboard - had to use a small box to prop the bottom of the headboard off the wall so the outlet could be used. Bed spreads were clean, but the carpet was stained.\n\nIf they replaced the A/C unit, put a plate on the outlet, added an extension cord for the lamp, maybe added some small night stands or shelves for the bed outsides, adjusted the one headboard, and thoroughly cleaned the carpet, I'd have no complaints.",
        "time": 1716190946,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Craig Strong",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107754043478243117700/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWYYxLI6WvEdCrsd5-DAyD9quT_ZPcz-hepgK317zufYrLag0R=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Good for a cheap place to sleep. The room seemed clean and didn't smell. Would be nice to have somewhere to hang clothes and coats. Shower could use some repair. It's close to a noisy road so not good for light sleepers. The owners are friendly. Not sure what others are expecting.",
        "time": 1670882932,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "F G",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106564897908064652037/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUCY6IHeik7uZcyZXybVcOHd39YOTnO3DuEBsTFMjv1zWBc4tA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "THE BEST MOTEL IN MONTREAL HISTORY!!!!!! I had a great time staying there for 2 weeks and the food the location and the rooms were amazing I loved it I wish I can come back!!!!!!",
        "time": 1749487999,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Emma Roussy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101295120737949327195/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL5k33ITw39q-NPpQ9eoSrqYsxLiUbKdpZQ1h7MXMl5_aQoHw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Rooms were insanely dirty. Water stains on all the walls, doors and chairs. Garbage left under beds. No smoke detector and open wires hanging in bathroom where a fan should’ve been. Only good thing about it was the bed was comfy and sheets appeared clean. Other than that would never recommend staying there.",
        "time": 1650557641,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Buggy Repo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106019104813689817801/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVECINvX3lPgD7maN15I8yiwXsCqbLHILDJ25mfU5DBT2Ryed8-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "It’s an old relatively cheap motel. It seems clean enough in my room. Once I turned the heat on in the bathroom the place warmed up and it was comfortable enough for a night. The people stomping around in the room upstairs are lovely lol it’s a bit run down but the only real complaint I have is the smell - it’s …. Not pleasant. But not really bad… just different I guess",
        "time": 1633045933,
        "translated": false
      }
